{"id":439416326,"author":{"login":"ravachol","id":9517715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTc3MTU=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOJkBsTc4aMPYG","tag_name":"v4.4.3","target_commitish":"main","name":"v4.4.3","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-11-09T17:08:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T17:13:32Z","published_at":"2026-11-09T17:09:40Z","assets":[{"id":728291422,"node_id":"RA_kwDOJkBsTc4raNhe","name":"kew-4.4.3-windows-x64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdos-program","state":"uploaded","size":7865736,"digest":"sha256:f8c4c672e90c09d22a34600aca0b44c6e1ca9800bdd7633e062f80c953492f35","download_count":55,"created_at":"2026-11-09T17:13:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T17:13:26Z"},{"id":728291818,"node_id":"RA_kwDOJkBsTc4raNnq","name":"kew.flatpak","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.flatpak","state":"uploaded","size":1862016,"digest":"sha256:d93a66aa8507726631ce726dece841053a376072971b5f97d11af20d7e4b7e42","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-11-09T17:13:31Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T17:13:32Z"}],"body":"## kew 4.4.3\r\n\r\nThis release fixes kew sometimes hanging at the end of a song, the scrollbar not scrolling all the way to the top and a few other things.\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to @Erwin-Iosef for making many PRs!\r\n\r\n/Ravachol\r\n\r\n#### Enhancements\r\n\r\n- Added error message if kew fails to play song because it's missing or corrupt. By @Erwin-Iosef.\r\n\r\n- Erase whole words from search query with Ctrl+Backspace. By @Erwin-Iosef. Suggested by @yeka1063.\r\n\r\n- Add build option DEBUG=3 mode which has fsanitize=thread enabled. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n#### Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Fix kew sometimes hanging at the end of a song. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix scrollbar not scrolling all the way. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Bumped miniaudio to v0.11.26. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix error message in some cases disappearing before the 3 second timeout. By @Erwin-Iosef.\r\n\r\n- Revert change that made some options stop working. By @Erwin-Iosef. Reported by @washingmachine55.\r\n\r\n- Fix use after return in visualization build cmd functions. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to seek_elapsed. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to visualizations running variable. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to visualizations mode variable. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix passthrough for forced coverStyle inside tmux. By @rdocksey.","mentions_count":5}
